## Summary

I shipped a production-polished, Apple-idiomatic **`FreshnessIndicator`** shared surface at parity with `web/src/components/data-display/FreshnessIndicator.tsx`, as 9 files under `apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/`:

**Architecture** (mirrors the canonical `AIChatbotIndicator` leaf): pure `Adapter` (verbatim ports of `computeAge`/`getStatus`/`formatAge`/`useIsStale`), pure `Projection`, `@Observable @MainActor` `Model` (P1/S8 source seam + injected clock + P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry + P1/S10 i18n facade), `Views`, main view, `Previews`, `.strings`, and two test files.

**Parity & states** — every state renders, never a blank box: `loading` (skeleton), `error` (retry chip), `empty`(unknown→neutral dot + "—"), `stale` (amber + one-shot auto-refresh), `offline` (red, last-known), `fresh` (pulsing green). Reproduces the 4 statuses, dot tones/sizes (6/8pt), the fresh `animate-pulse` (Reduce-Motion-aware), the `title` tooltip, the 10s tick, and the `useIsStale` hook. All copy via the i18n facade (no English literals); VoiceOver labels + design-token typography throughout.

